cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "AdminForge: Declarative Privileged-Identity Management for Linux Server Fleets"
abstract: >-
  An open-source command-line tool that manages accounts, SSH keys and permissions on Linux
  server fleets from one operator machine: the operator edits the declared state, previews
  the changes, and applies them over SSH, recording every action in a local history and
  installing nothing on the hosts.
type: software
